{"page":20199,"part":1,"text":"宋曹\n\n\n\n\n宋曹，情初顺治年间书法家。字彬臣，一字邠臣，号射陵。江苏盐城人，明崇祯时官中书，入清后，隐居不仕，工诗善书。\n\n\n\n\n《书法约言》，一卷。彬臣夙以能书称，是编首为「总论」两篇，不作浮词，至为扼要；次为「答客问书法」一篇，发挥《笔阵图》及过庭《书谱》所言书法之意，设为问答以明之；又次「论作字之始」一篇，略叙书体变迁之迹，别无论议；最末论楷书、行书、草书三篇，切实精到，足以为法。\n\n\n\n\n书法约言\n\n\n\n\n总论\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n又\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20199,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"1d4b54a07ce6484b53e96c16d422f7aa477a2c8feeae66c35c4337916efafa27","textSha256":"1d4b54a07ce6484b53e96c16d422f7aa477a2c8feeae66c35c4337916efafa27","fileSha256":"1d4b54a07ce6484b53e96c16d422f7aa477a2c8feeae66c35c4337916efafa27","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20199-work-141.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"书法约言 · 题解与篇首","sourceUrl":"","originalPages":[575,576,577,578],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":2,"sourceTextSha256":"542d65adb08bea82d3ae1822cd206cedcea9d9b88b6fda51b61f83be8fd3009e","id":"local-575-6-8","page_id":575,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":6,"rawEnd":8,"reviewedTextSha256":"281ca4e2ba9a2036e63986c3baba0101cd21ee58e31ce165df81f9b3ebfd449a","displayUnitOrigins":[[6,7],[7,8]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":575,"part":3,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"宋品宣","verifiedAt":"2026-10-15T07:49:33.651Z","revision":"281ca4e2ba9a2036e63986c3baba0101cd21ee58e31ce165df81f9b3ebfd449a","textSha256":"281ca4e2ba9a2036e63986c3baba0101cd21ee58e31ce165df81f9b3ebfd449a","fileSha256":"337dfa6c51e668ea709348ab712a3393735bf97aa642fd0d59f41a894d9ef262","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-18-part3-feedback-review/member-input/第3份-逐页校勘 (1).txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-18-part3-feedback-review/member-input/第3份-TXT校验表 (1).csv"}},{"start":4,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b","id":"local-575-8-9","pag